4","session_datetime":"2023-08-14T00:35:00","session_id":"session_14","session_index":14,"source_sha256":"3e89fc34bf38991714532e49599d9f9d3d7bcc687d1a2d8182629bd553f41ec4","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":16}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Wow, Calvin, sounds amazing! Got any pictures from that show? Would love to see the atmosphere.\n[S14T7] (dia_id: D14:7)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, here's a pic I took. It was so awesome - I loved how the crowd was into it. These moments are why I love my job.\n[Image caption: a photography of a crowd of people at a concert with their hands up]\n[S14T8] (dia_id: D14:8)\n\nDave: The energy in that pic is awesome! Seeing everyone with their hands up must have been really cool. It's great when your passion brings joy to others!\n[S14T9] (dia_id: D14:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, that was buzzing! It's moments like these that make me so proud and motivated. I'm all about spreading joy with my art. So, how's your project going?\n[S14T10] (dia_id: D14:10)\n\nDave: Yeah, the project is going great! Here's a pic of the car I'm restoring. It's pretty cool seeing it go from a beat-up mess to a real beauty.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car with a broken engine in the woods]\n[S14T11] (dia_id: D14:11)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave, that car is going to look amazing when you're done. How long do you think it will take to restore it?\n[S14T12] (dia_id: D14:12)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Fingers crossed it'll be all fixed up by the end of next month. Lots of elbow grease but it'll be worth the transformation.\n[S14T13] (dia_id: D14:13)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave, I'm really excited to see the end result of your hard work! You've got some serious talent!\n[S14T14] (dia_id: D14:14)\n\nDave: Thanks, Cal! Your support means a lot to me.\n[S14T15] (dia_id: D14:15)\n\nCalvin: You got this, Dave! I'm always here for you. Seeing your enthusiasm is amazing. Keep growing, buddy. It'll be 